  "title": "Drunken Flat Iron Steak",
  "description": "Flat iron steak is marinated in two kinds of vermouth and then seasoned with red pepper flakes just before frying. A friend tried something like this in Texas and this was our version of it.",
  "authors": [
    "Cocina JNOTS"
